# coldmail-platform holds the platform's code (Go service, web app, migrations, harness) and the cross-module documents and evidence behind the modules.
# Never credentials: this file exists so that stays true when someone drops a stray file into the working tree.
# NOTE: scratch/ is TRACKED on purpose (the raw per-module inventories the audit was built from, kept
# so a conclusion's inputs can be re-checked). Do not ignore it.

# Secrets and local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Local agent / editor state
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Output of verification runners run against this repo (the runners themselves live outside it)
*.log
# EXCEPTION: the run logs under Docs/history/audit-scratch/ are the evidence the records cite by run ID (verification-runs.md). Keep them.
!Docs/history/audit-scratch/**/*.log
*.tmp

# Build and harness output
/out/
/bin/
*.test
tests/harness/work/
